title: "Residual Learning and Channel Attention for CIFAR-10 Classification: A Reproduction and Empirical Study"
abstract: >-
  A controlled reproduction of residual learning on CIFAR-10, extended with
  squeeze-and-excitation channel attention, together with ablations on depth,
  attention placement, mixup and label smoothing.
